								Writing clean, memory-efficient modern C++ (17/20), optimizing GPU-CPU data transfers, batching draw calls, and profiling via RenderDoc and NVIDIA Nsight.
							</p>
						</div>

						<div class="philosophy-card">
							<div class="philosophy-title">
								<span>🛠️</span>
								<span>Procedural Pipelines & Tooling</span>
							</div>
							<p class="philosophy-desc">
								Automating DCC artist pipelines with the Blender Python API, procedural geometry generators, and robust asset versioning in Git LFS.
							</p>
						</div>

						<div class="philosophy-card">
							<div class="philosophy-title">
								<span>🥽</span>
								<span>Standalone XR Optimization</span>
							</div>
							<p class="philosophy-desc">
