					<div class="contact-right">
						<div>
							<div class="cv-downloads-title">Curriculum Vitae Downloads</div>
							<p style="font-size: 0.88rem; color: #94a3b8; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
								Download updated 2026 CV formats in English and Italian:
							</p>
